<title>HONG KONG: Chow resigns from Cheung Kong companies.</title>
<headline>Chow resigns from Cheung Kong companies.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd, Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, and Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday Albert Chow will resign as deputy manging director of Cheung Kong and a director of Hutchison and of Hongkong Electric effective from April 30.</p>
<p>His resignation was due to personal reasons, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>He will continue as a non-executive director of Cheung Kong thereafter, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
